s had never witnessed  before even before marvel's and dc  superheroes drew large crowds to the  movies optimus prime and his team were  already protecting the world thereby  paving the way for all other comic book  adaptions loud colorful and big that was  their motto and despite all the  criticism the series has received over  the years this promise was always kept  how do you view it what are your  thoughts on how the movie series has  evolved are you looking forward to the  sequel of the blockbuster series and  above all what do the transformers mean  to you today are they just a fun child  of memory or are they still the kind of  entertainment a visit to the cinema  needs let us know what your opinion is  in the comments and be sure to check out  our videos solely on transformers rise  of the beasts see you next time  [Music]  you

